{"id":"4338267410bc733e","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-game3-extensive-form-game.md","title":"ZFC Game3 Extensive Form Game","display":"df-zfc-game3-extensive-form-game — ZFC Game3 Extensive Form Game","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game3-extensive-form-game","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game3-extensive-form-game"],"display":"df-zfc-game3-extensive-form-game — ZFC Game3 Extensive Form Game","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-sequences]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game3-extensive-form-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game3-extensive-form-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game3-extensive-form-game — ZFC Game3 Extensive Form Game"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ea3fa70993b84c0\" href=\"?note=9ea3fa70993b84c0\" title=\"58-df-sequences\">58-df-sequences</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,H,N,A,P,u \\in V\">\\(G,H,N,A,P,u \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Term}(H)\">\\(\\operatorname{Term}(H)\\)</span> is the terminal-history set defined below</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3ExtensiveFormGame}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3ExtensiveFormGame}_S\\)</span> is the six-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}terminal\\text{-}histories} \\vdash \\operatorname{Term}(H)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in H:\\neg\\exists a\\;(h\\mathbin{{}^\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle\\in H)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}terminal\\text{-}histories} \\vdash \\operatorname{Term}(H)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in H:\\neg\\exists a\\;(h\\mathbin{{}^\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle\\in H)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}extensive\\text{-}form\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame3ExtensiveFormGame}_S(G,H,N,A,P,u)\\leftrightarrow G=\\langle H,N,A,P,u\\rangle\\land\\emptyset\\in H\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;\\forall m\\leq|h|\\;(h\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m\\in H)\\land N\\neq\\emptyset\\land P:H\\setminus\\operatorname{Term}(H)\\to N\\land A:H\\setminus\\operatorname{Term}(H)\\to\\bigl(\\mathcal P(\\bigcup\\bigcup H)\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\bigr)\\land\\forall h\\in H\\setminus\\operatorname{Term}(H)\\;\\forall a\\;(a\\in A(h)\\leftrightarrow h\\mathbin{{}^\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle\\in H)\\land u:N\\times\\operatorname{Term}(H)\\to\\mathbb R\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}extensive\\text{-}form\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame3ExtensiveFormGame}_S(G,H,N,A,P,u)\\leftrightarrow G=\\langle H,N,A,P,u\\rangle\\land\\emptyset\\in H\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;\\forall m\\leq|h|\\;(h\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m\\in H)\\land N\\neq\\emptyset\\land P:H\\setminus\\operatorname{Term}(H)\\to N\\land A:H\\setminus\\operatorname{Term}(H)\\to\\bigl(\\mathcal P(\\bigcup\\bigcup H)\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\bigr)\\land\\forall h\\in H\\setminus\\operatorname{Term}(H)\\;\\forall a\\;(a\\in A(h)\\leftrightarrow h\\mathbin{{}^\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle\\in H)\\land u:N\\times\\operatorname{Term}(H)\\to\\mathbb R\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Histories are prefix closed, every nonterminal history has an available-action set, and payoffs are assigned at terminal histories.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sequences","status":"resolved","id":"9ea3fa70993b84c0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sequences]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,H,N,A,P,u \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Term}(H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3ExtensiveFormGame}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}terminal\\text{-}histories} \\vdash \\operatorname{Term}(H)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in H:\\neg\\exists a\\;(h\\mathbin{{}^\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle\\in H)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}extensive\\text{-}form\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame3ExtensiveFormGame}_S(G,H,N,A,P,u)\\leftrightarrow G=\\langle H,N,A,P,u\\rangle\\land\\emptyset\\in H\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;\\forall m\\leq|h|\\;(h\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m\\in H)\\land N\\neq\\emptyset\\land P:H\\setminus\\operatorname{Term}(H)\\to N\\land A:H\\setminus\\operatorname{Term}(H)\\to\\bigl(\\mathcal P(\\bigcup\\bigcup H)\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\bigr)\\land\\forall h\\in H\\setminus\\operatorname{Term}(H)\\;\\forall a\\;(a\\in A(h)\\leftrightarrow h\\mathbin{{}^\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle\\in H)\\land u:N\\times\\operatorname{Term}(H)\\to\\mathbb R","display":true}],"bytes":1517,"backlinks":[{"id":"c0cd9cf0111388d9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据